    <ul class="nav nav-pills">
      <li class="nav-item">
        <a class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="pill" href="#globus">Globus</a>
      </li>
      {% if 'desktop-sync' in services %}
      <li class="nav-item">
        <a class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="pill" href="#sftp">SFTP Client</a>
      </li>
      {% endif %}
    </ul>

    <div class="tab-content">
      <div class="tab-pane container active p-1" id="globus">
        <p style="margin-top: 10px">
          To access the share via Globus, search for "KU LEUVEN - RDM SFTP Shares", <br />
          or open the <a href="https://app.globus.org/file-manager?origin_id=04f4e3bb-f598-4903-811b-3b3a2c3ab7bd">file manager directly</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      {% if 'sftp-server' in services %}
      <div class="tab-pane container fade p-1" id="sftp">
        <p class="mt-3">
          You can also use SFTP to connect to iRODS and use programs such as Filezilla, WinSCP or <code>lftp</code>.
          It is a file transfer protocol on top of SSH and SSH certificates are used for authentication.
        </p>
        <p>
          <i>Note that after June 1st, the SFTP service will be firewalled. You will either need to connect from a managed laptop, an HPC node, a device in the KU Leuven L- or S-zone,
          or to open the web firewall page 
          <a href="{{ services['web-firewall']['url'] }}">{{ services['web-firewall']['url']|replace("https://", "") }}</a>,
          before attempting to connect.</i>
        </p>
        <ol>
          {% if '-hpc-' in jobid %}
            <li>
              You need to run an <code>ssh-agent</code> capable of handling SSH certificates.
              <br />
              For Windows, <a href="https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/latest.html">Pageant 0.78</a> or above can be used.
              For Linux, the standard OpenSSH agent will work.
            </li>
            <li>
              Connect with e.g. Putty to <code>firewall.vscentrum.be</code> with agent forwarding enabled.
              After having successfully connected, an SSH certificate should be injected in your forwarded agent.
            </li>
          {% else %}
            <li>
              Install <a href="https://admin.kuleuven.be/icts/services/ssh-cert">certagent or kmk</a> on your local machine
              and use it to retrieve an SSH certificate.
            </li>
          {% endif %}
          <li>
            Open FileZilla or WinSCP, and connect using the following information:
            <dl class="mx-auto ml-20 mt-3">
              <dt>Hostname</dt>
              <dd>
                {{ services['sftp-server']['url']|replace("sftp://", "") }}
              </dd>
              <dt>Port</dt>
              <dd>
                22
              </dd>
              <dt>Username</dt>
              <dd>
                {{ session['openid_session']['username'] }}
              </dd>
              <dt>Password</dt>
              <dd>
                Leave empty. For FileZilla set 'Authentication type' to 'Interactive'.
              </dd>
            </dl>
            Or use <code>lftp -u {{ session['openid_session']['username'] }}, {{ services['sftp-server']['url'] }}</code>.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>